\nDoctoral College\nPreparing a PhD\nThesis\nInternational\nCampus Life\nYou are here:\nHome\nInternational\nWelcome\nInternational PhD Student Welcome\nLire cette page en fran\u00e7ais\nYou will soon complete your PhD at the Universit\u00e9 Grenoble Alpes, welcome!\nGoing abroad is an adventure, and you surely have a lot of questions regarding the preparation of your future stay. Our international portal and the ISSO team are here to help you!\nOn this website you will find:\nThematic Sections\nPresenting the main aspects of your future life in France:\nApplication and admission to a Doctoral school\nThe steps of your stay\nVisas and residence permits\nAccommodation\nInsurances\nBudget\nDaily life\n> The UGA international web portal\nA welcome guide to download\nIt will give you an overview of the steps you will have to go through, from admission to obtaining your student card.\n> Download\nWhat you need to know\nIf you are coming with your family, the ISSO service can also help them with their installation procedures (visa validation, schooling of children, etc.). Consult our Family section for more information.\nWithin the framework of our partnership with the Euraxess France network, PhD students and researchers can benefit from privileged services, such as access to a private housing base. To benefit from it, simply register (free of charge) to ISSO's International Researcher Support Database.\nOnce on site\nCan't find the answer to your question on the UGA international portal? Need more detailed information? Having trouble with an administrative procedure? Come and talk to the ISSO teams in Grenoble and Valence, in dedicated reception areas:\nFind ISSO reception areas in Grenoble and Valence\nLearning French\nThe Coll\u00e8ge doctoral, in collaboration with the CUEF, has set up a French language learning program to help you make the most of your stay in France.\nConsult the offer\nPublished on January 28, 2021\nUpdated on October 1, 2026\nDownload\nThe practical guide for international PhD students [pdf]\nThe UGA knows how to welcome its international PhD students\n\"Welcome to France\": Universit\u00e9 Grenoble Alpes awarded for the quality of its international student welcome\nPrint\nShare\nShare this on Facebook\nShare this on LinkedIn\nInternational\nInternational Partnerships\nInternational PhD Students Welcome\nJoint PhD (cotutelle)\nCall for International Projects\nDoctoral College - Universit\u00e9 Grenoble Alpes\nMaison du doctorat Jean Kuntzmann\n110 rue de la Chimie 38400 Saint-Martin-d'H\u00e8res\nFrance\nLegal notices\nContacts\nPersonal details\nCookies\nWebsite accessibility: not compliant\nFollow us\nFacebook\nYoutube\nX\nURL of the page\nhttps://doctorat.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/international/international-phd-students-welcome/international-phd-student-welcome-801415.kjsp?RH=1611138496625\nPage title\nShare the link\nCopy\nCopied\nClose the modal window\nShare the URL of this page\nI recommend:\nConsultable at this address:\nLa page sera alors accessible depuis votre menu \"Mes favoris\".\nStop video\nPlay video\nMute\nPlay audio\nChat: A question?\nChatbot Robo Fabrica\nMatomo traffic statistics\nX (formerly Twitter)\nWhat are you looking for ?\nEnter a keyword and press Validate\nSearch on text :\nMore", "links": [["Universit\u00e9 Grenoble Alpes", "https://doctorat.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/universite-grenoble-alpes-/"], ["CSV Doctoral School", "https://doctorat.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/doctoral-schools/csv-doctoral-school/"], ["EEATS Doctoral School", "https://doctorat.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/doctoral-schools/eeats-doctoral-school/"], ["I-MEP\u00b2 Doctoral School", "https://doctorat.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/doctoral-schools/i-mep-doctoral-school/"], ["ISCE Doctoral School", "https://doctorat.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/doctoral-schools/isce-doctoral-school/"], ["LLSH Doctoral School", "https://doctorat.univ-grenoble-alpes.fr/doctoral-schools/llsh-doctoral-school/"], ["MSTII Doctoral School", "https://doctorat.uni